  tierReadouts:
  - TierLabel: Response 1 Laser Soldier
    StageRole: Low-cost boss rifleman that creates the first readable dodge-line
      check without waiting for a high-tier bank.
    PlayerRead: Read the thin aim line, dodge after the lock, then punish the rifleman
      before the next boss action.
    SummonRead: A cheap summon can body-clash the rifleman, but the primary read is
      movement first.
  - TierLabel: Response 2 Pressure Screen
    StageRole: Boss-side summon pressure that contests the frontline for several
      seconds and blocks player follow-up shots.
    PlayerRead: Take EN only long enough to prepare a clean response, then break
      the screen before the next boss pattern layers on top.
    SummonRead: Use SummonSlot1 or Vanguard support to absorb the curtain and reopen
      ranged punish time.
  - TierLabel: Response 3 Laser Soldier
    StageRole: High-cost boss laser summon that creates a dodgeable line threat instead
      of another pressure screen.
    PlayerRead: Read the thin line, dodge after the aim locks, then punish during
      the rifleman's recovery.
    SummonRead: Boss laser soldier repositions, draws a cyan warning line, locks
      aim, then fires a short ticking beam.
